---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import companyData from '../data/company.json';
---

<Layout
	title="Golf Cart Rentals at World Equestrian Center (WEC) Ocala | Masters Golf Cars"
	description="Rent golf carts for World Equestrian Center events in Ocala, FL. Fleet rentals for horse shows, equestrian events. Delivery to WEC grounds. 26+ years experience. Call (352) 307-0111"
	canonical="https://mastersgolfcars.com/golf-cart-rentals-wec"
>
	<!-- Hero Section -->
	<section class="bg-white py-12 md:py-16">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
				<div>
					<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-4">Golf Cart Rentals at World Equestrian Center</h1>
					<p class="text-xl text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
						Need a golf cart for <strong>World Equestrian Center</strong> in Ocala? <strong>Masters Golf Cars</strong> has you covered. We rent golf carts to people who compete, watch, or work at WEC horse shows.
					</p>
					<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-6">
						We have been helping horse people in <strong>Marion County</strong> for over 26 years. Our shop sits on <strong>US-441</strong> in Belleview, about 15 minutes south of WEC. With more than 300 golf carts ready to go, we can handle events big or small.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
						<a href="/fleet-rentals-quote" class="bg-brand-green text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition text-center">
							Request Fleet Quote
						</a>
						<a href="tel:3523070111" class="bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition text-center">
							Call (352) 307-0111
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<img src="/images/gallery/golf-cart-fleet-rentals-at-masters-golf-cars_img_v27.webp" alt="Golf cart fleet rentals for World Equestrian Center events" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" width="800" height="600" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Why Choose Us for WEC -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-12 text-center">Why WEC Exhibitors Choose Masters Golf Cars</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
				<div class="space-y-6">
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">We Know Big Events</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Horse shows need lots of carts. We get it. <strong>Masters Golf Cars</strong> keeps more than 300 golf carts in stock. That means we can rent to one barn or to a whole event. We bring carts to you, set them up, and pick them up when you leave.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">We Deliver Right to WEC</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Tell us where you need your cart. The <strong>Grand Arena</strong>? The <strong>Equestrian Hotel</strong>? Your barn on the back side? Our drivers know their way around WEC. We drop off carts right where you want them.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div>
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Gas-Powered Carts That Run All Day</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
							Our carts run on gas. You do not have to charge them. Just add fuel and keep going. This works great for long show days at <strong>World Equestrian Center</strong>, from early morning warm-ups to late night events.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-lg mb-6">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Events We Serve at WEC</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-6">
							<li>&#10003; HITS Ocala Winter Circuit</li>
							<li>&#10003; Dressage Shows</li>
							<li>&#10003; Hunter/Jumper Events</li>
							<li>&#10003; Breed Shows</li>
							<li>&#10003; Western Events</li>
							<li>&#10003; Trade Shows at WEC</li>
							<li>&#10003; Private Parties</li>
							<li>&#10003; Year-Round Competitions</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-brand-green text-white rounded-lg p-8">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Rent by the Day, Week, or Month</h3>
						<p class="mb-4 font-semibold">
							We make it easy. Rent for one day or many weeks. Just tell us your show dates. Book early for big WEC events so you get the carts you need.
						</p>
						<a href="/fleet-rentals-quote" class="inline-block bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-gray-900 transition">
							Get a Custom Quote
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Cart Options -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-brand-green text-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-12 text-center">Golf Carts We Rent for WEC Events</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mb-6 bg-white rounded-lg p-4">
						<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/2-seater-golf-cart_img_v63_250813_142814136.webp" alt="2-passenger golf cart for WEC" class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-64 mx-auto" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">2-Passenger</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Great for riders and trainers. Small enough to fit down barn aisles. Easy to park at the show rings.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1 font-semibold text-sm text-left max-w-xs mx-auto">
						<li>&#8226; Fits in tight spaces</li>
						<li>&#8226; Good for one or two people</li>
						<li>&#8226; Easy to drive</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mb-6 bg-white rounded-lg p-4">
						<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/4-seater-golf-cart_img_v64_250813_142836603.webp" alt="4-passenger golf cart for WEC events" class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-64 mx-auto" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">4-Passenger</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Our most popular pick. Families love it. Trainers use it to move riders and grooms around <strong>World Equestrian Center</strong>.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1 font-semibold text-sm text-left max-w-xs mx-auto">
						<li>&#8226; Room for four people</li>
						<li>&#8226; Space for bags</li>
						<li>&#8226; Comfy for long days</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mb-6 bg-white rounded-lg p-4">
						<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/6-seater-golf-cart_img_v65_250813_142855008.webp" alt="6-passenger golf cart for large groups" class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-64 mx-auto" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">6-Passenger</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Perfect for big barns. Move your whole team fast. Great for VIP guests too.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1 font-semibold text-sm text-left max-w-xs mx-auto">
						<li>&#8226; Holds six people</li>
						<li>&#8226; Good for barn managers</li>
						<li>&#8226; Client transport</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center">
					<div class="mb-6 bg-white rounded-lg p-4">
						<img src="/images/golf-cart-rentals-page/utility-cart_img_v66_250813_142912878.webp" alt="Utility golf cart for equipment" class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-64 mx-auto" loading="lazy" width="400" height="300" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Utility Cart</h3>
					<p class="mb-4 font-semibold leading-relaxed text-sm">
						Got stuff to haul? Use this one. Carry tack, feed, and gear around the 378-acre WEC grounds.
					</p>
					<ul class="space-y-1 font-semibold text-sm text-left max-w-xs mx-auto">
						<li>&#8226; Big cargo bed</li>
						<li>&#8226; Made for heavy loads</li>
						<li>&#8226; Barn work ready</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- About WEC -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
				<div>
					<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">About World Equestrian Center Ocala</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold mb-4">
						<strong>World Equestrian Center</strong> sits on 378 acres in <strong>Marion County, Florida</strong>. It is one of the biggest horse show spots in the world. The place has 19 show arenas, the famous <strong>Grand Arena</strong>, and space for over 2,000 horses.
					</p>
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold mb-4">
						WEC is located off <strong>US-27</strong> near <strong>Ocala</strong>. The <strong>Equestrian Hotel</strong> on site has shops and restaurants. Horse shows run here all year long. People fly in from all over the country.
					</p>
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed font-semibold mb-6">
						The grounds are huge. Walking takes too long. A golf cart helps you get from the hotel to your barn to the show ring and back. <strong>Masters Golf Cars</strong> makes it easy to rent one.
					</p>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
						<div>
							<p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">378</p>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-sm">Acres</p>
						</div>
						<div>
							<p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">2,000+</p>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-sm">Horse Stalls</p>
						</div>
						<div>
							<p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">19</p>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-sm">Show Arenas</p>
						</div>
						<div>
							<p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-green mb-1">Year-Round</p>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold text-sm">Events</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<img src="/images/gallery/golf-cart-fleet-rental-delivery_img_v35.webp" alt="Golf cart fleet delivery for equestrian events" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg mb-6" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" />
					<img src="/images/logos/masters-golf-cars-fleet-rentals_img_v36.webp" alt="Masters Golf Cars fleet ready for delivery" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- How It Works -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-12 text-center">How to Rent Golf Carts for WEC</h2>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
				<div class="space-y-8">
					<div class="flex gap-4">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">1</div>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Ask for a Quote</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">
								Fill out our form. Tell us your show dates and how many carts you need. Let us know where at WEC you want them dropped off.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex gap-4">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">2</div>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Book Your Carts</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">
								We will call you back with prices. Book early for big shows. Carts go fast during the <strong>Winter Circuit</strong> and major events.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex gap-4">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">3</div>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">We Bring Them to You</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">
								Our team drives your carts to <strong>World Equestrian Center</strong>. They come with gas and are ready to go. We drop them off before your event starts.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="flex gap-4">
						<div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">4</div>
						<div>
							<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">We Pick Them Up</h3>
							<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">
								When your show ends, tell us. We come get the carts. You do not have to bring them back yourself.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<img src="/images/gallery/02-04-2025-14-23-09_23.webp" alt="Golf cart delivery for events" class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-lg mb-8" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600" />
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-8 shadow-lg">
						<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">What You Need to Rent</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-6">
							<li>&#8226; Be at least 21 years old</li>
							<li>&#8226; Have a valid driver's license</li>
							<li>&#8226; Have a credit card</li>
							<li>&#8226; Book ahead of time</li>
							<li>&#8226; Ask about group discounts</li>
						</ul>
						<a href="/fleet-rentals-quote" class="inline-block bg-brand-green text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition w-full text-center">
							Request a Fleet Quote
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Testimonials -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<h3 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 text-center mb-4">What Our Horse Show Customers Say</h3>
			<div class="flex justify-center gap-1 mb-12">
				{Array.from({ length: 5 }).map((_star, index) => (
					<svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="#FFD700" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
						<path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z" />
					</svg>
				))}
			</div>
			<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
				<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-semibold">
						"Masters Golf Cars made our WEC show so much easier. They brought the cart right to our barn. It ran great all week. We will use them again!"
					</p>
					<p class="font-black text-gray-900">-Jennifer L., Hunter/Jumper Trainer</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-semibold">
						"We rented 8 carts for our barn during the winter shows. Great service. Fair prices. The carts worked great. We tell everyone about Masters."
					</p>
					<p class="font-black text-gray-900">-Michael R., Barn Manager</p>
				</div>
				<div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-gray-100">
					<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-semibold">
						"Great people to work with. They showed up on time. The cart ran well the whole show. I tell all my WEC friends to call them."
					</p>
					<p class="font-black text-gray-900">-Scott L., Exhibitor</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Related Services -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
				<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">Other Ways We Can Help</h2>
				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">HITS Ocala Rentals</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
							Showing at <strong>HITS Post Time Farm</strong> too? We rent carts there as well. Same great service.
						</p>
						<a href="/golf-cart-rentals-hits-ocala" class="text-brand-green font-bold hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-2">
							HITS Ocala Rentals
							<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
							</svg>
						</a>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Fleet Rentals</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
							Need a lot of carts? We do big events. Learn about our fleet deals.
						</p>
						<a href="/fleet-rentals-quote" class="text-brand-green font-bold hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-2">
							Fleet Rental Info
							<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
							</svg>
						</a>
					</div>
					<div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-200">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Golf Carts for Sale</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 font-semibold mb-4">
							Want to own a cart? We sell <strong>Club Car</strong>, <strong>Yamaha</strong>, <strong>EZ-GO</strong>, and <strong>Advanced EV</strong>. New and used.
						</p>
						<a href="/golf-carts-for-sale-ocala" class="text-brand-green font-bold hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-2">
							View Inventory
							<svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
								<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
							</svg>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Location Section -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl">
			<div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr,1fr] items-start">
				<div class="space-y-4">
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900">Easy to Find - Close to WEC</h2>
					<p class="text-gray-600">
						<strong>Masters Golf Cars</strong> is at <strong>12885 S US Highway 441 in Belleview</strong>. We sit between <strong>Ocala</strong> and <strong>The Villages</strong>. Look for us across from the <strong>Market of Marion</strong> flea market.
					</p>
					<p class="text-gray-600">
						From WEC, head south on <strong>US-27</strong> to <strong>US-441</strong>. Takes about 15 minutes. You can also take <strong>I-75</strong> to exit 341 and go east on <strong>SR-200</strong>.
					</p>
					<ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-2">
						<li><strong>Address:</strong> {companyData.location.full}</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Phone:</strong>{' '}
							<a href={companyData.contact.phoneLink} class="text-brand-green hover:underline">
								{companyData.contact.phone}
							</a>
						</li>
						<li>
							<strong>Email:</strong>{' '}
							<a href="mailto:info@mastersgolfcars.com" class="text-brand-green hover:underline">
								info@mastersgolfcars.com
							</a>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
						We deliver to WEC and other horse farms in <strong>Marion County</strong>. Call us to set up your rental.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-gray-200">
					<iframe
						src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d6976.811623455518!2d-82.025011!3d29.034576000000005!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x88e7cfcec122cd0d%3A0x530a32876eeda9ee!2sMasters%20Golf%20Cars!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1762801860534!5m2!1sen!2sus"
						width="100%"
						height="400"
						style="border:0;"
						allowfullscreen=""
						loading="lazy"
						referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
					></iframe>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- CTA Section -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white">
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl text-center">
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-6">Ready to Rent Golf Carts for WEC?</h2>
			<p class="text-xl mb-8 font-semibold text-gray-300">
